st dedicated local debugging tool specifically designed for AI agents with MCP-native integration and one-command installation.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">First dedicated local debugging tool specifically designed for AI agents</div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">MCP-native with one-command installation</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span>Released: 2026-05-14</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/cline-sdk\" target=\"_blank\">Cline SDK</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Plugin-based open-source runtime for building coding agents. Allows developers to create custom AI coding agents with a modular, extensible architecture.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">Build coding agents with a plugin-based open-source runtime</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span>Released: 2026-05-15</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/openhuman\" target=\"_blank\">OpenHuman</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Open-source AI agent/harness with persistent memory across sessions. Local-first, privacy-first with 118+ integrations (Gmail, Slack, Notion, GitHub). Features a Memory Tree system that canonicalizes context and includes a built-in code sandbox.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">8000+ GitHub stars, 5000+ users in first 7 days</div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">Reached #1 on Product Hunt daily leaderboard May 15, 2026</div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">118+ integrations including GitHub with built-in code sandbox</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span>Released: 2026-05-15</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/openclaw-os\" target=\"_blank\">OpenClaw OS</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Turns one-off AI chat sessions into persistent, reusable applications. Open-source tool that converts ephemeral AI agent interactions into usable apps for developers.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">Turns one-off chats into persistent apps</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span>Released: 2026-05-14</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Middle Column: Whitelist Updates (35%) -->\n            <section class=\"whitelist-updates\">\n                <h2>Whitelist Updates</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"update-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Code</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"update-subtitle\">Plugin System, Agent View, Background Sessions</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Major updates including plugin dependency enforcement, agent view for session management, enhanced background session persistence, and numerous UI/UX improvements. Windows PowerShell tool now enabled by default for Bedrock/Vertex/Foundry users.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span>Released: 2026-05-15</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"update-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Cursor</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"update-subtitle\">Development Environments, Multi-Repo Support, Teams Integration</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        May 2026 updates: Development environments for cloud agents with isolated containers, multi-repo environments support, environment configuration as code with Dockerfile improvements, Cursor in Microsoft Teams integration, Bugbot Effort Levels customization, PR Review experience improvements, parallel plan execution, and Split PRs feature.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span>Released: 2026-05-01</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"update-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/label/copilot/\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub Copilot</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"update-subtitle\">Copilot App Technical Preview, REST API Support</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n            